 "blockers": [],
 "notes": [
  "All commands are public reads and need no login. The HTML /search and /gems listing pages are disallowed by robots.txt, so use search-gems (JSON API) for searching.",
  "Gem names are case-sensitive slugs, for example 'oj' or 'rails'. Version numbers must be exact strings such as '3.17.7'. Use get-latest-version or list-gem-versions to find them.",
  "get-gem returns the latest version's dependencies. For the dependencies of an older version, use get-gem-version.",
  "list-reverse-dependencies returns a flat array of gem names that can be very long (871 for oj). Use search-reverse-dependencies to filter by name and to get downloads and versions.",
  "Download counts in the HTML listings are display strings (for example '+77.6 Million Downloads' or '3,845,448,471'), not numbers.",
  "Gem detail pages request GitHub repository info from api.github.com. That is a third-party call and is not included here."
 ],
